WHAT THIS LICENSE COVERS AND WHAT IT DOES NOT

This license covers the dataset as compiled here: the selection, the
bilingual summaries we wrote, the ranking, and the documentation.

It does not and cannot cover the linked source material. Each item points at
something published elsewhere — an article, a paper, a tweet, an episode — and
that content remains the property of whoever published it, under whatever terms
they set. Titles and URLs are recorded here as facts about those publications.

The collection pipeline that produces this data is not open source and is not
covered by this license. It is not distributed in this repository.
